			"notes": "The mod is a client-side Minecraft PvP training tool that:\n\n    Detects when you take damage.\n    Displays an 80 ms jump-reset timing bar.\n    Shows the bar shrinking as the timing window expires.\n    Changes to the success color when you press jump during the window.\n    Plays a sound when a successful jump reset is detected.\n    Uses a larger indicator for better visibility.\n    Supports configurable bar colors and outline settings.\n    Includes optional hit notifications through /jumprest status.\n    Provides profiling commands for recording damage, jump, reset, and HUD events.\n\nIt detects damage after your health decreases. It does not currently predict attacks or verify the server’s internal jump-reset result."
